# The OpenAPI client is generated from ../../contracts/api/*.openapi.yaml — not tracked (mirrors the backend,
# which generates into build/). Produced by `pnpm run generate:api`; run automatically on install via the
# `prepare` script. Regenerate after a contract change; never hand-edit.
src/api/generated/

# Leftover local dev seed from the retired `seed:dev` (cr-api-callers-typed-by-the-contract): throwaway accounts
# incl. raw key material. The seeder is gone but old checkouts still hold the directory — keep it ignored so it
# can never be committed.
scripts/.seed/

# Stryker mutation testing: the HTML/JSON reports + the in-place backup/temp dir are build
# artifacts. The incremental report (reports/stryker-incremental.json) is the CI *cache* (ADR 0045 §4),
# restored via actions/cache — never committed.
reports/
.stryker-tmp/
